# Cloudflare Pages — redirects (relative paths only).
#
# www -> apex is NOT handled here: Pages rejects absolute source URLs, so an
# earlier `https://www.fotoskiasis.com/*` line was silently ignored. It belongs
# in a zone-level Redirect Rule instead:
#
#   Cloudflare -> fotoskiasis.com -> Rules -> Redirect Rules -> Create
#     If hostname equals   www.fotoskiasis.com
#     Then dynamic URL     concat("https://fotoskiasis.com", http.request.uri.path)
#     Status 301, preserve query string
#
# Until then both hostnames serve the site, and every page's canonical tag
# points at the apex, so search engines consolidate on fotoskiasis.com.

